Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ninety-one，Ninety-two…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's down there。Where？If they catch us…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a million bottles of booze in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think they're gonna miss one？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Weather is with us，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,We arrive in port in a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're welcome，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，I never smelt anything like this。Not even when you're in the crapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.51,0:02:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，what，your shit smells like roses？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.39,0:02:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thought you said it was booze。That's what the papers said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，we have a breach in lower level。Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which section？101.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck。Take the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.24,0:03:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir。Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close the door！Get the masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morning。Passport，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rough seas？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sea was smooth。The party was a bit rough，if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ibiza。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I was a kid，my father used to take me fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.67,0:04:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never could figure out how he knew where the fish were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were always exactly where he said they would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Security check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do I look like a security risk？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please step out of the car and bring your documents to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,My documents are right here，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.61,0:05:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The computer is in the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,With her documents。Okay，sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。You're gonna lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close，inspector，you're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a big one。Go left，go left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.98,0:06:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go left，go left！Go right！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must be Moby Dick you hooked。Need some help？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，thank you，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.07,0:06:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have been fishing these waters since before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were close，inspector。You were close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good thing that we French have such a highly developed sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,With all due respect，the French think Jerry Lewis is a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jerry Lewis is a genius。- Dean was the genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Dean just stood there with a drink and a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.87,0:07:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,My point exactly。Anyone can fall down and get a laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many people can do it standing still with a drink and a cigarette？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am afraid our day of leisure is cut short.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is a big mess in Marseilles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.89,0:07:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some madman driving an Audi at impossible speeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is the first place the chief told me to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I will tell him you have the perfect alibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,As usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tarconi！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！I am sorry，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's our first bite！Yeah，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:07:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop the boat。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No，Frank。Come on，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Purpose of your visit，Mr。Johnson？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind of business？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Environmental protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Minister，you're giving the opening address at an EU conference…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,on environmental impact of industry in Odessa tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is top on your list of priorities？It's a short list.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.83,0:09:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's only one item：The environment and how to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.77,0:09:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the face of increasing pressure…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,for industries to compete successfully in a global economy…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,that goal can sometimes come up against some very harsh realities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，not as harsh as a polluted and uninhabitable planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.61,0:09:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen，if you'll excuse me now…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have trees to save and industrialists to disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your speech for tomorrow。Any good？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's going to piss off a lot of people。Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Minister？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been put in charge of the negotiations…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,you are engaged in with Ecocorp…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,for issuance of their license to do business in the Ukraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.57,0:10:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must be misinformed，Mr。Whatever-Your-Name-Is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've terminated negotiations permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you will reconsider that position…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,once you have a chance to study the documents in the envelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.43,0:10:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，there's been an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send an ambulance，8 Route de la Falaise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:11:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malcolm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.73,0:12:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malcolm。Malcolm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I asked you for your price。What is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,A man who might be interested in taking the job。This man will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,My boss said you're the man for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your boss got his facts wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two things you should know about my boss：
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,He never gets his facts wrong，he never takes no for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.53,0:12:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there's a first time for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't wanna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think you're in a position to tell me what I do and don't wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have 10 seconds to change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll give you five seconds to remove your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.56,0:14:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malcolm。Malcolm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hear me？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.53,0:14:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mal，I said drop in anytime，but I didn't mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.23,0:14:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nowhere else to go。Just take it easy，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't move me from the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.07,0:14:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just get you comfortable till the ambulance arrives。No ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need a doctor，you've been shot。I can't take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not far from car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just try to stay calm。We'll have you fixed up in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's inside。Quick，it's serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.41,0:14:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.61,0:14:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna be careful moving him。We know our job，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，can you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,This car No…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you hear me，press my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The car…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I in heaven？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，you're in a bit of the shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll help me out of it？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,That depends on how deep you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't trust anyone。Couldn't agree with you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。No！Don't leave the car！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.65,0:16:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's so special about the car？Not the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.74,0:17:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of bringing your suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.47,0:18:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's what you wear when you're working，correct？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Correct。But I'm not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，boss？I told you。Please，Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your approach was not very effective in presenting our proposal the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.25,0:18:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,As I was saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,we came to you in good faith。You said you were unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,We contracted with the man whose number you gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,He proved to be ineffective.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now I am left with unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,The way I see it，you're responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I understand your point of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'm still unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boss，can I say something？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyone else wanna say something？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.35,0:18:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find me a smarter one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have three seconds to change your mind…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,or you're gonna be permanently unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.19,0:19:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,One condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I drive my own car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.11,0:19:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,In anticipation of your answer，we took the liberty of bringing your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Changed the oil，gave it a tune-up，took out all the non-essential material.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.85,0:19:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Left the switch-over license plates。Love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Replaced the GPS with one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.06,0:19:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Preprogrammed。More efficient that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why I was so insistent on using only the best man for this assignment？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're playing in a much larger game here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.74,0:19:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't think of this as just another job。Think of it as a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.45,0:20:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so pleased to find we share the same approach to our work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I make a deal，that's the deal。Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't like names。Neither do I。We're both precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neither one of us has any interest in what we're paid to do…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.99,0:20:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,beyond what we are paid to do。Those are your rules，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You forgot one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I work alone。I thought you might like the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thought you wanted me to complete a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.28,0:20:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're right。I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.95,0:20:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，you wanna change the rules？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every rule has an exception。Let's make one for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.43,0:20:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything else？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:20:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The jewelry。Anything I should know？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You remember those jokers trying to blow up airliners…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.41,0:21:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,by sneaking liquids through and combining them onboard？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Same principle，just refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty-five feet from the car…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,yellow light comes on，signaling the first liquid is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifty feet，orange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.66,0:21:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Second liquid flows into the chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.59,0:21:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seventy-five feet，you're gonna see red.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.80,0:21:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.07,0:21:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,This phone is programmed to call only one number，mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,When you pass the first toll on the road going north，call me，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Money for gas and food.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any other questions？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.82,0:22:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you mind buckling your seat belt？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't suppose you wanna tell me what this is all about？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.87,0:22:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.49,0:23:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ocean Pearl requesting cargo clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.76,0:23:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,The papers are with the environmental agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.66,0:23:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drop anchor and wait to dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.77,0:23:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll inform you when they're signed。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.88,0:23:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what happened to Frank？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Colonel Medved over at Intelligence has been given all the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.63,0:23:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knows it's top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wants you to know he has his best men on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.93,0:23:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll keep it out of official channels.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.30,0:23:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,He suggests you buy as much time as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.42,0:24:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I don't know what your part in all this is or isn't。And I don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.33,0:24:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were here first，you know more than I do…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.83,0:24:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,download me on what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.73,0:24:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.50,0:24:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did you know Malcolm？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.71,0:24:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just happened to end up in a car with a man you don't know？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.75,0:25:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm now in a car with man I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.72,0:25:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to make a call？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.72,0:25:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.39,0:25:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can skip the pleasantries。Just give me the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.80,0:25:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,1-1-2-6.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call me when you arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.87,0:25:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's in Budapest？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.44,0:25:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goulash。Beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.72,0:25:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.15,0:25:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's rewind here，start with the proper introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.59,0:25:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to the rule of no names？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.33,0:25:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm suspending that rule for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.47,0:25:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Frank Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.97,0:25:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And your name is？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.61,0:26:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,What matters，my name？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.58,0:26:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we're in this situation together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.05,0:26:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.25,0:26:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're sitting here with two exploding bracelets on，going to the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.16,0:26:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd call that being in the same situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.56,0:26:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not。They are going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.13,0:26:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.10,0:26:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,In all probability，after they kill me，you're next on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，if I'm gonna keep that from happening，I'm gonna need a little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.04,0:26:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,From the top。We have this problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.88,0:26:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think I don't know it's a problem？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.31,0:26:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I look stupid to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.88,0:26:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't say you were stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.12,0:26:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we have a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.69,0:26:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you're not being very helpful in participating in the solution of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.03,0:26:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to talk anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.67,0:27:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.32,0:27:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you say your name was？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.02,0:27:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank。Frank Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.99,0:27:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.49,0:27:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Valentina.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.09,0:28:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,The gentlemen from Ecocorp are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.73,0:28:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.70,0:28:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.97,0:28:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.71,0:28:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd like to thank you for reconsidering our proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.78,0:28:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,on such short notice。You make it very hard not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.91,0:28:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，yes。We do have a reputation of not taking no for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.49,0:29:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here are the contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,All in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.72,0:29:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were told the ships couldn't be cleared
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.96,0:29:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,unless you personally signed off on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.16,0:29:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ships？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.06,0:29:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought there was only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.70,0:29:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，well，here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.37,0:29:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,In order to make the venture more profitable
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.30,0:29:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,we need to process the material in a volume that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.47,0:29:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many ships are we talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.31,0:29:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Plus the one in the port waiting on clearance，eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.71,0:29:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,This year.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.72,0:29:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Protecting the environment is a long-term commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.95,0:29:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've said so yourself，haven't you？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.16,0:29:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I will do again tomorrow in Odessa
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.89,0:29:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,where I will sign these.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.73,0:29:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were really hoping to settle this today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.70,0:29:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to review them，now that there are some addendums.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.27,0:29:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty-four hours doesn't make a difference
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.64,0:29:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,on such a long-term commitment，will it？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.78,0:30:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.68,0:30:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I will see you tomorrow in Odessa。Let's say 9 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.56,0:30:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.16,0:30:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.09,0:30:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the material is leaking everywhere。And？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,We won't be able to hide it。I'll take care of it，just give me some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.70,0:30:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,If ever they check…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.20,0:30:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy。The deal will be closed very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.70,0:30:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty-four hours。No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.45,0:30:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？I've bought you another 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.42,0:30:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have until tomorrow，9 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.92,0:30:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,That should be more than enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.35,0:30:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have a lead？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.39,0:30:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better than a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.03,0:30:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,A location.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.60,0:31:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.60,0:31:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're 100 kilometers from beer and sausage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.57,0:31:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't like sausage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.78,0:31:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What would you like？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.88,0:31:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Veal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.72,0:31:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roast，with carrots…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.85,0:31:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,and beets.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.86,0:31:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,In gravy，with Madeira in stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.09,0:31:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing to start？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.93,0:32:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.53,0:32:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Greens tossed with balsamic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.97,0:32:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,From Modena.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.94,0:32:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aged？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.54,0:32:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，aged.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.55,0:32:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,And for dessert？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.82,0:32:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sachertorte.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.95,0:32:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,With whipped cream or without？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.82,0:32:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,With.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,To drink？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.73,0:32:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.13,0:32:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tokaj，perhaps？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.47,0:32:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ice wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.41,0:32:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？Seeing a man about some jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.93,0:33:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gone off the reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.83,0:33:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send someone to get him back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.80,0:33:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank。It's so good to see you，mein Freund.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.37,0:33:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good to see you too，Otto.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.04,0:33:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't mention you bring company.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.07,0:33:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not really company.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.74,0:33:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.58,0:33:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.88,0:33:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,With you，it's always complicated。But you can tell me about it…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.05,0:34:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,over a nice schnitzel with Kartoffelsalat I have prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.42,0:34:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Otto，you know I love your schnitzel
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.79,0:34:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we need to get rid of this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.76,0:34:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Binary free-form magnetic-resolution technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.73,0:34:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,English，please，Otto.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.40,0:34:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a program the Pentagon has funded
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.60,0:34:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,through one of their subsidiary front companies
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.91,0:34:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,that's been experimenting with this new kind of weaponry
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.44,0:34:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,based on the theory of magnetic attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.28,0:34:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very hush-hush stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.98,0:34:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you were in the loop on the Pentagon hush-hush.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.09,0:34:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe what you can discover
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.32,0:34:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,when you left your fingers walking through the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.69,0:34:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna see the invasion plans for Iran？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.39,0:34:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.33,0:34:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now we need to get this thing off without blowing myself to Iran.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.97,0:34:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't wanna bother you with the details
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.60,0:34:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,but usually there's a transmitter plate close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.35,0:35:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should not be doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.01,0:35:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,First you don't talk，now you offer advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.22,0:35:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not advice。A warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.02,0:35:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，a little late for warnings，don't you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.86,0:35:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.63,0:35:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're off course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.31,0:35:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should I？Yeah，you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.92,0:35:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，fellas
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.32,0:35:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,some things in the car were a bit off，needed checking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.66,0:35:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,In my profession，a man is only as good as the car he drives.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.16,0:35:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You take care of the car，the car will take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.53,0:35:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,The boss says，「Back on the road.」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.37,0:35:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.50,0:35:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.27,0:36:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back in the car，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.08,0:36:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.68,0:37:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find it？Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.49,0:38:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the smart one？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.30,0:38:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I'm the big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.08,0:39:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not so big anymore，are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.01,0:39:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.05,0:40:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,The transmitter。Can you remove it？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.05,0:40:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's wired.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.59,0:40:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I do：it comes boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.35,0:41:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You fight good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.42,0:41:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,But your tie bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.16,0:41:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.69,0:41:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.66,0:41:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why I prefer to deal with cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.73,0:41:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,That makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.94,0:41:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do when they？When they wake up？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.11,0:41:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probably best to take the rest of the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.53,0:41:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not amused.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.86,0:41:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd be less amused if you ended up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.93,0:42:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you wanted me dead，I'd be dead。You need me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.53,0:42:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want me to complete the job，I need some clarification.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.97,0:42:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.54,0:42:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,In person.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.87,0:42:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've already done in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.51,0:42:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，not to my satisfaction，apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.34,0:42:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，my satisfaction should be your main concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.35,0:42:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Same place。One hour。Wait for my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.77,0:43:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.04,0:43:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've disappointed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.18,0:43:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You won't be the first and you won't be the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.45,0:43:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you I wanted to do this in person。That won't be necessary。You see…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.42,0:43:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,since our little chat at the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.69,0:43:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been thinking I don't need the best for this mundane assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.39,0:43:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any idiot with a driver's license will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.76,0:43:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,So in the words of the great American，Donald Trump：
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.00,0:43:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，but you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.68,0:44:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.12,0:44:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your new chauffeur。I want the old one back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.92,0:44:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's about to go to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.72,0:45:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.89,0:45:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,How was your nap？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.30,0:45:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Restful。How was your phone call？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.90,0:45:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Brief。Fasten your seat belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.28,0:46:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tarconi.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.48,0:46:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.68,0:46:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was wondering when you would call.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.62,0:46:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.02,0:46:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me guess。In Budapest？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.92,0:46:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been busy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.76,0:46:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never a problem keeping that way with a friend like you，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.79,0:46:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I don't have to be redundant，tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.83,0:46:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is a black Mercedes also in Budapest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.47,0:46:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probably not occupied by friends of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.74,0:46:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is what I know。Now tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.17,0:46:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have two bags in the back and a girl in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.71,0:46:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Russian，I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.84,0:46:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what she has to do with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.21,0:46:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you tried asking her？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.38,0:46:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，why didn't I think of that？Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.65,0:46:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course you've asked。And she says？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.99,0:46:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.49,0:46:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Typical。Russians.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.99,0:46:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are so dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.39,0:46:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I remember，in school，reading Dostoyevsky and thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.10,0:47:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,when do these people laugh？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.97,0:47:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,One page after the other
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.84,0:47:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,misery and suffering like you wouldn't believe，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.01,0:47:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector，can we save the literature lesson？I'm blinking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.61,0:47:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that code？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.74,0:47:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's some bracelet they accessorized us with.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.38,0:47:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wired to explode if we get too far from the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.82,0:47:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,They？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.52,0:47:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some American.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.79,0:47:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you be more specific？A name？A number？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.82,0:47:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.06,0:47:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you always make it so easy，Frank？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.46,0:47:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's my nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.36,0:47:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you？I will come there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.40,0:47:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not a good idea。They have me on a short leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.07,0:47:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't be of much help if you do not give me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.54,0:47:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,How close are you to a computer？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.51,0:47:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Frank？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.81,0:47:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,That wasn't very nice，back there in the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.78,0:47:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were the one who broke the rules，not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.82,0:47:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Point well taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.15,0:47:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,That makes us even。What say we start with a clean slate？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.89,0:48:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,So this call is about kiss-and-make-up，then？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.66,0:48:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.93,0:48:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have what I need to get the bracelet off…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.03,0:48:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have the packages you need delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.90,0:48:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here are the new coordinates，then：2-6-12.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.84,0:48:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,That'll take you to the place…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.51,0:48:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,where we can have a conclusion to this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.01,0:48:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.75,0:48:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.25,0:48:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you get it？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.46,0:48:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got the signal。Give us a little time…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.59,0:48:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we should have his number and location.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.20,0:48:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your new phone，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.81,0:48:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything else？No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.28,0:48:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank，do you know where the signal is taking you？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.36,0:49:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know restaurant there。Fish like you never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.70,0:49:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roasted with small carrots and black pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.07,0:49:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Romanian wine，not so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.24,0:49:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,But for the last meal，could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.58,0:49:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really should begin to think more positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.05,0:49:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm realist.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.35,0:49:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,My friend was right when he said you were doom and gloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.22,0:49:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,What means 「doom and gloom」？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.29,0:49:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，you only see the horrible and the terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.43,0:49:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your friend，where does he get this？He doesn't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.63,0:49:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was talking about you in general。Russians，as a people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.10,0:49:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not Russian。I'm Ukrainian.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.94,0:49:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.20,0:49:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not excused。We're different people。We're different here…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.47,0:49:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,and here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.31,0:50:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me，personally，I think there's a little bit of an optimist in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.89,0:50:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you can make such a statement？You don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.29,0:50:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I see you're putting makeup on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.83,0:50:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you were so convinced we was gonna die，why bother？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.87,0:50:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What does looking good have to do with dying？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.08,0:50:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.18,0:50:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.55,0:50:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Souvenirs from Ibiza。Do you want one？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.32,0:50:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，thank you。And neither do you。We need to stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.42,0:50:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.23,0:50:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.93,0:50:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I stay，how you say？Optimist？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.27,0:51:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me that。Give me that thing。Give me the pill！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.94,0:51:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me that…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.31,0:51:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.92,0:51:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.66,0:51:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just great。Come on，Frank Martin，lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.13,0:51:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should？How about when those pills hit？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.19,0:51:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna be lighting up like a goddamn Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.03,0:51:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.67,0:51:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boring。Boring。Boring？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.34,0:51:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.54,0:52:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should stay in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.64,0:52:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want me to pee in car？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.28,0:52:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.36,0:52:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.95,0:52:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.48,0:53:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.94,0:53:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.63,0:53:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.87,0:54:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop，all right？Why？I don't drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.78,0:54:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.98,0:54:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to be happy。You should try happy instead of so serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.65,0:54:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's important to stay positive，like you say，yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.88,0:54:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drink with me，Frankie。I don't want a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.86,0:54:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now who is all gloomy and doomy？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.56,0:54:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say it right？Gloomy doomy？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.53,0:54:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.77,0:54:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am free，like a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.84,0:55:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,The girl！Come on！Faster！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.39,0:55:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have lost my friend！I'll buy you a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.37,0:55:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have any idea why we have a car on our ass？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.71,0:55:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.41,0:55:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mind？First you say I'm doom and gloom…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.01,0:55:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,and now you tell me do not be happy？Make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.57,0:56:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Frank？I thought we had an agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.20,0:56:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.67,0:56:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,It had nothing to do with a car on my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.17,0:56:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have anything to do with that。Someone else has issues with you？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.81,0:56:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.38,0:56:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I think is that there are other forces at work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.92,0:56:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me check into it，see what I can find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.52,0:56:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do I do in the meantime？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.32,0:56:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drive faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.96,0:57:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.29,0:58:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,There！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.26,0:58:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's down there！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.23,0:58:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.73,0:58:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should have thought about a sandwich，not vodka.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.17,0:58:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.61,0:58:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wasn't hungry then，I was thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.95,0:59:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why you are so mean to me？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.95,0:59:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not being mean。I'm preoccupied。- What means 「preoccupied」？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.79,0:59:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,That means preoccupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.11,0:59:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoot the tires！Come on！Get him！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.91,0:59:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get down！Shoot him！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.19,0:59:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bloody hell！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.54,0:59:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Faster！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.21,1:00:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop the car！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.71,1:00:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.95,1:01:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.58,1:01:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're so tense.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.42,1:01:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.02,1:01:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I make you relax，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.03,1:01:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I'm good at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.33,1:01:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Making tense go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.57,1:01:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.94,1:01:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to feel sex one more time before I die.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.91,1:01:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.65,1:01:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it with you and dying？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.52,1:01:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is something wrong with me？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.79,1:01:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I not sexy？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.43,1:01:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，you're sexy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.60,1:02:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the gay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.90,1:02:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nope，I am not the gay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.34,1:02:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.38,1:02:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.25,1:02:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then what's the problem？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.02,1:02:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did it ever occur to you that maybe I'm not in the mood？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.11,1:02:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought rule is don't open package。It is.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.84,1:02:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why you have rules if you break them？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.81,1:02:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I keep asking myself the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.98,1:02:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Phone books.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.39,1:03:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the package。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.83,1:03:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could have said something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.73,1:03:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would it make a difference？Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.40,1:03:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now what are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.97,1:03:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，back in garage…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.61,1:03:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,it was very turn-on to me when you take off your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.68,1:03:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was trying to keep five cretins from caving my head in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.55,1:03:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't see the turn-on in that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.18,1:03:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think it's only man gets turned on by striptease？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.46,1:03:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't like where this is going，Valentina.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.69,1:03:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you striptease for me again？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.36,1:03:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the keys。This is not funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.20,1:03:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want keys？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.87,1:03:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to stop playing around，is what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.37,1:03:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe it's last chance to play around for you and for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.84,1:03:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not the time or the place for playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.55,1:03:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do I get feeling with you it's never time or place？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.82,1:04:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I wanna get analyzed，I'll see a psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.32,1:04:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，give me the keys.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.09,1:04:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Frank Martin.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.62,1:04:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make playtime for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.91,1:04:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right？That enough？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.62,1:04:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not enough。That is not a striptease，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.59,1:04:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Striptease is sexy。You know，move your ass a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.46,1:04:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Frank Martin.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.76,1:04:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want keys？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.06,1:04:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want strip.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.07,1:04:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I'm gonna do to you for making me do this？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.87,1:04:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spank me？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.87,1:04:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,For starters.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.31,1:05:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tie me up？You'd like that，wouldn't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.38,1:05:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like the rough stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.35,1:05:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.66,1:05:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，but not too rough.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.43,1:05:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Deal was a striptease for the keys.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.00,1:05:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,New deal。Kiss me for the keys.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.11,1:05:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like you mean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.72,1:05:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you ever kiss like you mean it，Frank？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.02,1:05:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm thinking maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.59,1:05:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm thinking you live alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.86,1:05:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inside and outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.60,1:05:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thinking it is not dying you're afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.77,1:05:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's living.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.90,1:06:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Live with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.64,1:06:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just this once.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.61,1:06:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just this moment。Live with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.38,1:06:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's his position？We lost him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.42,1:06:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,He headed into the mountains。We can't get reception up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.59,1:06:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hack into one of the military satellites.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.20,1:07:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.50,1:07:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think we're playing games here，Mr Minister？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.97,1:07:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.97,1:07:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm talking about a black car full of your incompetent operatives.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.51,1:07:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,One more move like that and you will never see your daughter again.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.78,1:07:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to hear her voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.38,1:07:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,When the contract is signed and delivered.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.22,1:07:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will not sign until I hear her voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.82,1:07:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are in no position to play hardball，Mr Minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.62,1:07:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，neither are you，Mr Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.40,1:07:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.46,1:07:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I can assure you，if anything happens to my daughter…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.73,1:07:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will use all the power I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.80,1:07:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will hunt you down and make you pay in a most hideous way for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.64,1:07:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have to move now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.05,1:07:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pick up，Frank。Pick up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.77,1:08:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in Ibiza。Making holiday.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.75,1:08:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone hands me glass of champagne.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.21,1:08:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.75,1:08:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I don't feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.17,1:08:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I go to bathroom，and next thing，I'm awake in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.50,1:08:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ask him，「Where is this？」 He tells me he's just a transporter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.18,1:08:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's pretty good driver.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.48,1:09:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not like you good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.72,1:09:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I tell him，「Please。My father a really powerful man.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.76,1:09:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Big influence。Knows a lot of people。Let me call him.「
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.53,1:09:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's afraid。He's never done this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.67,1:09:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be simple。Pick up，drop off。Easy money.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.44,1:09:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's been told no calls，never leave car.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.41,1:09:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I convince him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.04,1:09:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I call.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.35,1:09:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,But before I say to my father where we are…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.78,1:09:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inside the car。Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.76,1:09:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,We get away，but…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.59,1:09:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's people shooting at us。Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.43,1:09:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why they shooting at us？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.80,1:09:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says they shoot because we didn't go according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.07,1:10:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said，「Okay，that's the old plan。What's new plan？」
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.74,1:10:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says he has a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.95,1:10:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then I met you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.06,1:10:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then I feel it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.33,1:10:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't even know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.30,1:10:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.90,1:10:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I talk about feelings，not knowing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.54,1:10:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，if you was feeling that way，you sure had a funny way of showing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.65,1:10:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better for a woman to have a little mystery to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.45,1:10:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,No？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.49,1:10:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.49,1:10:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Just a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.22,1:11:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's back on the radar，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.43,1:11:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Where the hell are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.53,1:11:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the way to Bucharest.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.06,1:11:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not any longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.54,1:11:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,New coordinates：3-7-13.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.08,1:12:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，Mr。Minister.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.51,1:12:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.88,1:12:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inspector Tarconi，from Marseilles.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.59,1:12:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，not exactly Marseilles…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.05,1:12:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,but a small town to the east What do you want，inspector？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.19,1:12:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,A word with you。I have no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.86,1:12:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's about your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.60,1:12:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Odessa，Frank。My country.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.87,1:12:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,You take me home。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.05,1:12:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to Bucharest？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.55,1:12:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Change of plans。It's a good change。I prefer Odessa.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.05,1:13:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.59,1:13:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was looking forward to that fish with the carrots myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.93,1:13:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's much better here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.13,1:13:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know chicken Kiev？I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.43,1:13:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know restaurant here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.84,1:13:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Best in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.37,1:13:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The chicken's so fresh。And the butter，when it's coming out…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.91,1:13:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like you cannot believe，it's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.75,1:13:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I feel like now？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.85,1:13:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.66,1:13:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.04,1:13:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's going to end up like the movies，this happily ever after？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.54,1:13:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,By tonight，this is all gonna be a fading memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.65,1:14:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gonna be you and me，laughing over chicken Kiev.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.92,1:14:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.41,1:14:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Minister，an update，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.21,1:14:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am ready to sign the contract once I speak to my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.48,1:14:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.92,1:14:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have that pen ready。I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.20,1:14:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。We are closing the noose，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.97,1:14:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，when it closes，make sure no one tries to drag me out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.50,1:14:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what this is about yet？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.27,1:14:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,The girl。Her father.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.11,1:15:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Large amounts of toxic waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.85,1:15:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is a trade。His signature for her life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.92,1:15:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a reputation to uphold here，inspector.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.19,1:15:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,One hundred percent successful delivery rate.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.62,1:15:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I detecting a little attachment？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.59,1:15:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is not the Frank I know。With his rules，no names，no attachment.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.07,1:15:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is everyone so concerned about my rules？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.97,1:15:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank，I always suspected you are a romantic at heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.54,1:15:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything else？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.74,1:15:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is the rendezvous？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.61,1:15:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.29,1:15:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。We're almost at the end，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.12,1:15:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just give me the coordinates。No more coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.39,1:15:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,The road you're on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.73,1:15:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make your first left.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.86,1:15:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to know where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.14,1:16:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll know when you get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.64,1:16:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。We got them right where we want them.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.85,1:16:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,My compliments，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.01,1:16:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our trust in your abilities was well deserved.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.22,1:16:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now if you could please send the girl out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.69,1:16:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.56,1:16:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.36,1:16:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,They need you。They won't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.70,1:17:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.53,1:17:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do I look like a man who came halfway across Europe to die on a bridge？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.04,1:17:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do I？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.31,1:17:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't have all day，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.62,1:17:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look how many of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.39,1:17:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have all the guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.52,1:17:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,How it's gonna be okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.86,1:17:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell you over dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.83,1:17:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.00,1:17:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.44,1:17:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.05,1:18:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.43,1:18:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're gonna get me killed。Now，go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.69,1:18:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get to her，you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.25,1:19:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better now，darling？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.77,1:19:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finish him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.79,1:19:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Frank！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.37,1:19:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,His beloved car will be his grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.07,1:20:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leaves it，he blows。Stays，he drowns。Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.19,1:20:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tarconi。They have the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.46,1:20:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank，we are trying to track him through the phone signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.09,1:20:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you？In a lake.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.56,1:20:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,A lake？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.70,1:20:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you be more specific？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.77,1:20:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a dam.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.71,1:20:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,A dam？I know the place，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.84,1:20:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,How far？Ten minutes at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.88,1:20:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank，we'll be there in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.91,1:20:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you make it any faster？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.68,1:20:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll do our best。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.43,1:22:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buy tickets for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.54,1:22:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where to？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.14,1:22:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anywhere this train is going。We need to keep moving for half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.27,1:22:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't we just keep driving around？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.85,1:22:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another day.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.76,1:23:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir！There！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.48,1:23:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out。Out！Everybody out！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.86,1:23:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.02,1:23:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move，quick！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.54,1:23:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Minister？Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.85,1:23:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone wants to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.88,1:24:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Papa。Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.12,1:24:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't sign.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.49,1:24:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,What you have is 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.84,1:24:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ever find out what this is about？Garbage.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.74,1:24:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,How much garbage are we talking？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.21,1:24:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enough to pollute half the country for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.98,1:24:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.70,1:24:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,For a modern woman，you are very uninformed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.30,1:24:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the new world.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.14,1:25:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are no more countries。That's old think.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.84,1:25:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are just economic realities。Profit and loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.41,1:25:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Efficiency and waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.35,1:25:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think global，not local.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.15,1:25:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.90,1:25:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？Where are we？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.48,1:25:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.62,1:25:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.18,1:25:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here。He is on a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.85,1:25:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,And where are we？Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.39,1:25:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can get units there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.26,1:25:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a good idea。Do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.03,1:25:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Frank，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.77,1:26:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Minister，I assure you，everything is in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.54,1:26:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.84,1:26:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there are any problems I know you will solve them.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.61,1:26:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，if you don't mind…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.91,1:27:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You might not believe this，but I am，at heart，a pacifist.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.71,1:27:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate violence.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.78,1:27:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,It creates more problems than it solves.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.22,1:27:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I never wanted to do any of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.56,1:27:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,A client asked me to obtain a result…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.10,1:27:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,so I went about creating an environment…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.40,1:27:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,with the least amount of bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.37,1:27:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one wanted to cooperate。Not you，not the first driver…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.30,1:27:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,not your father，not the recently deceased Frank Martin.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.21,1:27:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone wanted to fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.16,1:28:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's so funny？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.60,1:28:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hearing a dead man talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.96,1:30:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,One more step，Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.33,1:30:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。One more.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.48,1:31:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.28,1:31:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.22,1:31:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two minutes to 9。He signed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.69,1:31:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.06,1:31:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Frank。No，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.50,1:32:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's over，Frank。It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.21,1:32:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished。You and the girl are free to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.28,1:32:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Matter of fact，I'm so impressed by your talent…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.81,1:32:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to offer you a position.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.68,1:32:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to offer you one。Permanently disabled.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.27,1:32:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate to waste talent.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.81,1:32:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I really don't think we'd make a very good fit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.31,1:32:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.60,1:33:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.64,1:33:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We wouldn't fit，but you and the bracelet were made for each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.38,1:33:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.96,1:33:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.63,1:33:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.58,1:34:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.30,1:34:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Valentina.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.18,1:34:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Valentina.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.72,1:34:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I in heaven？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.99,1:34:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks more like we're in hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.76,1:34:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.90,1:34:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,As long as we're there together.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.91,1:35:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.18,1:35:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Minister，your daughter is in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.85,1:35:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.97,1:35:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？What you said，the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.57,1:35:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now，gentlemen。if you'll excuse me，I have a conference to address…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.01,1:35:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,on the dangers of doing business with people like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.14,1:35:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.33,1:35:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is the launch ready？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.56,1:35:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's on the water，sir，waiting。Time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.63,1:35:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Grab the log。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.09,1:36:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.16,1:36:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I was a boy，my father and I…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.33,1:36:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,used to pull fish out of this very spot all day long.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.86,1:36:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Times change，inspector.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.10,1:36:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,As do people.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.84,1:36:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You referring to me？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.34,1:36:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think that's a very accurate statement.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.38,1:36:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I drive the same car，live in the same house.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.81,1:36:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I was not referring to your car or your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.82,1:36:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sea is so restful.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.39,1:36:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is lunch ready yet？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.82,1:36:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mademoiselle，there is a certain progression to things.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.33,1:37:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,In order to eat the lunch，you first have to catch the lunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.86,1:37:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if we keep talking instead of concentrating…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.30,1:37:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,we're gonna catch nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.83,1:37:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have better idea。Why we don't skip catching of lunch…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.77,1:37:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,and go right to eating of lunch？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.91,1:37:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know wonderful place just up coast from here…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.28,1:37:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,where they make fish stew。Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.38,1:37:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,They use tomatoes and onions，and little amount of wild lavender.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.85,1:37:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind of wine？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.96,1:37:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pink。From south.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.99,1:37:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,A Chateauneuf，perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.29,1:37:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Chilled。- Of course，chilled.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.93,1:37:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,And for dessert？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:37.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《非常人贩3》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,九十一 九十二
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿 哪儿？如果被他们发现了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的酒有上百万瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会知道少了一瓶么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气不错 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将在几小时后到达港口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 这种味道我从没闻到过 即使厕所的味道也比这好闻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.51,0:02:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的大便什么时候好闻过？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.39,0:02:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.46,0:03:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得你说运的是酒啊 文件上是这么写的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 船舱底层有情况 快看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个区？101
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,操 你来掌舵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.24,0:03:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 先生 操
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,关门！戴上防毒面具
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快处理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 请出示护照
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪很大？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以 只是派对上海过头了 你懂的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊比沙岛 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候 父亲常带我去钓鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.67,0:04:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一直不明白 他怎么知道哪儿有鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是准确无误
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全检查
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来像危险分子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,请下车 带上你的证件去办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,证件就在这儿 警官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.61,0:05:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但计算机在办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她的证件 好的 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 它要跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.87,0:06:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快了 警长 快钓上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是条大的 向左 向左
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.98,0:06:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快钓上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,向左 左边！向右！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定钓到了条白鲸 需要帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢谢 Frank
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.07,0:06:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这片儿钓鱼的时候 你还没出世呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快了 警长 快钓上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是 我们法国人皆具幽默感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 法国人认为Jerry Lewis是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jerry Lewis的确是个天才啊 - Dean才是天才
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 Dean只是拿著酒和香烟站在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.87,0:07:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但关键是他可以让所有人都捧腹大笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人可以拿著酒和香烟站在那 能做到这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我是Tarconi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我们的悠闲日子得提前结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,马赛那边出了点儿麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.89,0:07:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个疯子驾著奥迪横冲直撞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那样看著我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官让我注意观察第一反应
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会告诉他 你有完美的不在场证据
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,像往常一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tarconi啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮忙！对不起 Frank
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.99,0:07:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是第一次上钩！是啊 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:07:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,停船 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行 Frank 别这样 拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Johnson先生 您此行的目的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,生意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么生意？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,环境保护
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生 明天欧盟会议的开幕致词中 您将说到…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,工业对敖德萨环境的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键内容是什么呢？很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.83,0:09:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一项：环境 以及如何保护它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.77,0:09:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个经济全球化的时代…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,工业竞争取得成功的压力越来越大…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可否认 目标有时会和残酷的现实相冲突…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 更为残酷的是一个污染和不适于居住的地球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.61,0:09:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 请原谅…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去拯救树木 让工业家们扫兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,您明天的演讲稿 你觉得如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会令很多人生气 非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁并不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,您插手的 关于…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eco公司在乌克兰经营许可…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是由我负责谈判的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.57,0:10:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是谁 你肯定是弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经永久性终止谈判
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.51,0:10:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果您看过信封里面的文件…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为您会重新考虑的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.43,0:10:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好考虑下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 这里发生了事故
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,地址是德拉萨佛雷斯路8号 请派救护车来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:11:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malcolm啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.73,0:12:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malcolm Malcolm啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是问你的要价 这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个可能会对这个活儿感兴趣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.78,0:12:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老板说 你是最适合的人选
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老板搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我老板 你应当知道两件事：
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从不出错 他从不接受拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.53,0:12:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事都有第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想这样做的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没资格告诉我该做什么 不该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你10秒钟改变主意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你5秒钟 拿开你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.56,0:14:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Malcolm Malcolm啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听得到我说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.53,0:14:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mal 我是说过 你任何时候来 我都欢迎 但不是表示…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.23,0:14:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无处可去了 放松点儿 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别弄我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.07,0:14:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想在救护车来之前 让你舒服点 不需要救护车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要去看医生 你中枪了 我处理不了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能离开车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持冷静 你会没事儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里面 快 伤势很严重
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.41,0:14:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.61,0:14:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动他时你要小心 用不著你来教 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 能听到我说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆车不…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能听到 按一下我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆车…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点儿 小心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在天堂吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 你在地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮助我走出地狱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要看你陷得有多深了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要相信任何人 绝对同意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 不！不能离开车！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.65,0:16:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这车有这么特别么？跟车没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.00,0:16:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.74,0:17:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要相信任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我冒昧给你拿了套衣服来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.47,0:18:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你工作时的穿著 没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但我不是在工作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 老板？我告诉过你了 拜托 Joseph
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你在表达我们意愿时 没有用对方法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.25,0:18:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我说的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很有诚意去见你 而你却说你做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只给了我们一个电话号码 我们与电话上的人签了约
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实证明 他无法胜任
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我的生意还没完成
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 这是你的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.87,0:18:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板 我能说一句么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁想说话么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.35,0:18:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我找一个更聪明的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你三秒钟改变主意…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你永远也别想改了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.19,0:19:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要开我自己的车
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.11,0:19:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的回答早就在意料之中了 所以我们冒昧把你的车也开来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,换了油 优化了发动机 拿出了所有不必要的零件
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.85,0:19:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,更换了牌照 爱死它了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,装上了我们的全球定位系统
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.06,0:19:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,安装了既定程序的 这样会更有效率
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我要这么坚持 用最适合的人来完成这项任务呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在玩一个更大的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.74,0:19:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要以为这只是随便的一份工作 把它当成任务来完成
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.45,0:20:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴地发现 在对待工作上 我们有很多共同点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应了就会做到 你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢问名字 我也是 我们都很谨慎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,报酬以外的事情 我们都没有任何兴趣…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.99,0:20:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是你的规则 没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人干 我以为你可能会喜欢有个人作伴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你想要我完成任务
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.28,0:20:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 的确想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.95,0:20:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你想改变规则？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个规则皆有例外 今天就破例下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.50,0:20:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说了算
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.43,0:20:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:20:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个手镯 有什么你该告诉我的么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得那些小丑通过了安全检查 在飞机上却能把液体制成炸弹…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.41,0:21:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,想炸毁客机的事儿吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,原理相同 只是这个更精制
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,离车25英尺…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄灯亮 那是第一管液体已经准备好的信号
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十英尺 橙色
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.66,0:21:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二管液体准备就绪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.59,0:21:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,75英尺 你将会看到红色
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.80,0:21:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.07,0:21:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部电话只设置了我的号码
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了向北的第一个收费站 打给我 没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽油和食物的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.82,0:22:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,系上安全带好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不该告诉我 这一切究竟是怎么回事儿么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.87,0:22:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.49,0:23:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,海洋珍珠号请求货物清关
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.76,0:23:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,文件已送达环境署
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.66,0:23:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛下锚 在码头等候
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.77,0:23:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一签署 我们就通知你们 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是怎么回事儿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.88,0:23:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但Frank是怎么回事儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报局的Medved上校已经收到所有的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.63,0:23:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道那是头等大事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要您知道 他会派最得力的人负责
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.93,0:23:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会避开官方渠道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.30,0:23:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他建议您尽可能多的争取时间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.30,0:23:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,车能拖去实验室吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.30,0:23:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们开始吧 这儿完了我就过去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.80,0:24:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说开工
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.80,0:24:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,移开！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.80,0:24:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察在办公！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.42,0:24:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听著 我不知道你在这事上扮演什么角色 我也不关心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.33,0:24:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先加入 知道的比我多…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.83,0:24:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你所知道的 都告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.73,0:24:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.50,0:24:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么认识Malcolm的？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.71,0:24:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点就跟他一起死在车里了 还不认识？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.75,0:25:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在也跟一个不认识的男人坐在车里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.72,0:25:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是该打电话的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.72,0:25:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴接到你电话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.39,0:25:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,客套话就省省吧 给我密码
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.80,0:25:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是1-1-2-6
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了再打给我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.87,0:25:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,布达佩斯那儿有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.44,0:25:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈牙利肉汤 啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.72,0:25:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.15,0:25:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们重新来过 从正式介绍开始
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.59,0:25:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你办事儿不是从不问姓名的么？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.33,0:25:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条规则暂时放一边
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.47,0:25:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫Frank Martin
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.97,0:25:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你叫？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.61,0:26:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫什么有关系么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.58,0:26:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在同在一条船上
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.05,0:26:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.25,0:26:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩 带著两个都会爆炸的手镯坐在这儿 目的地相同
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.16,0:26:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就叫同坐一条船
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.56,0:26:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,错 他们会杀了你的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.13,0:26:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.10,0:26:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,十之八九 他们杀了我之后 你就是下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 如果要阻止这一切发生 我需要一点帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.04,0:26:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我们有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.88,0:26:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道有问题么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.31,0:26:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你看来 我很蠢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.88,0:26:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有说过你蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.12,0:26:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们的确存在一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.69,0:26:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过要解决的话 你也帮不上什么忙
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.03,0:26:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再说下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.67,0:27:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.32,0:27:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说你叫什么来著？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.02,0:27:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 叫Frank Martin
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.99,0:27:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank Martin啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.49,0:27:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Valentina啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.09,0:28:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 GPS系统已经被拆掉了 警长？没错 GPS系统已经被拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.09,0:28:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ecocorp公司的人到了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.73,0:28:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们进来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.70,0:28:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.97,0:28:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.71,0:28:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很感谢您在匆忙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.78,0:28:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新考虑我们的建议 想不考虑都难
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.91,0:28:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 对 我们从不接受拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.49,0:29:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是合约
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.72,0:29:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾被告知 除非得到您的亲笔签字
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.96,0:29:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则船队不能清关
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.16,0:29:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,船队？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.06,0:29:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为只有一只
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.70,0:29:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好的 是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.37,0:29:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了使这次冒险更具价值
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.30,0:29:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要增加份量 这样才会更有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.47,0:29:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所说的船 到底有多少只？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.31,0:29:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上在港口等待清关的 共八只
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.71,0:29:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,八只
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.72,0:29:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护环境并不能立竿见影
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.95,0:29:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己说的 没错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.16,0:29:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天在敖德萨同样会说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.89,0:29:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西到了那儿再签吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.73,0:29:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真心希望今天就能解决这事儿
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.70,0:29:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想再仔细看看 后面还有些附录
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.27,0:29:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这种长期承诺来说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.64,0:29:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,多二十四小时有何不同呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.78,0:30:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 当然不会
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.68,0:30:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 明天敖德萨见 早上9点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.56,0:30:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.16,0:30:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我等著
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.09,0:30:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是原料正在四处泄漏 然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们隐瞒不下去了 我会处理的 再给我多点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.70,0:30:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们查起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.20,0:30:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 交易很快就会达成的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.70,0:30:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十四小时 不能再拖了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.45,0:30:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？我为你们再争取了24小时
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.42,0:30:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,到明天早上9点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.92,0:30:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间绰绰有余
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.35,0:30:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有头绪了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.39,0:30:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止是有头绪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.03,0:30:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿到了一台定位器
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.03,0:31:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.03,0:31:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际刑警拿过来的片子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.03,0:31:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是通往罗多尔夫
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.03,0:31:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,联系我们的德国朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.03,0:31:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 可是我要说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.03,0:31:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们期待与我共进晚餐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.60,0:31:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.60,0:31:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离啤酒和香肠还有100公里远
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.57,0:31:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.78,0:31:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你喜欢什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.88,0:31:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小牛肉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.72,0:31:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,烤过的 和上胡萝卜…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.85,0:31:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有甜菜一起
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.86,0:31:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,加些汤汁 配上马德拉产的白葡萄酒
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.09,0:31:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不来个前菜？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.93,0:32:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份沙拉
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.53,0:32:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,用从摩地纳运来的意大利黑醋
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.97,0:32:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,拌的青菜
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.94,0:32:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,腌制的？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.54,0:32:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 腌过的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.55,0:32:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那甜点呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.82,0:32:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨赫蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.95,0:32:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要抹生奶油吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.82,0:32:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.73,0:32:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,葡萄酒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.13,0:32:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许 托卡葡萄酒？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.47,0:32:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,加冰么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.70,0:32:47.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（方向错误）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.41,0:32:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？去见一个对首饰很在行的人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.41,0:33:01.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（偏离路线）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.93,0:33:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走错了道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.83,0:33:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人去教教他该怎么走
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.80,0:33:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀他
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 见到你太好了 朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.37,0:33:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你 Otto
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.04,0:33:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没跟我说还带了女朋友来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.07,0:33:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.74,0:33:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.58,0:33:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.88,0:33:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟著你 有什么会不复杂的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.05,0:34:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备了一份美味的炸猪排和土豆色拉 我们可以边吃边谈…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.42,0:34:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 Otto 你知道我爱吃你做的炸猪排
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.79,0:34:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们首先得摆脱这个
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.76,0:34:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,二元自由形式磁性分解技术
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.73,0:34:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,说英语 拜托 Otto
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.40,0:34:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,五角大楼通过他们的一家附属公司
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.60,0:34:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,出资赞助了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.91,0:34:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,基于磁引力理论的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.44,0:34:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,研发新型武器的项目
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.28,0:34:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是极度机密的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.98,0:34:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不知道你在五角大楼的极度机密的消息圈内
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.09,0:34:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你任由你的手指在互联网上漫步时
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.32,0:34:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所发现的东西 会让你觉得难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.69,0:34:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看看入侵伊朗的计划书吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.39,0:34:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.33,0:34:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我们得把这玩意儿弄下来 不然被轰到伊朗去的就是我了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.97,0:34:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想拿细节来烦你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.60,0:34:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 通常都会有个发射器在附近的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.35,0:35:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.01,0:35:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前你不想说 现在你又来劝告
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.22,0:35:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是劝告 是警告
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.02,0:35:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你不认为警告来得有点迟了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.86,0:35:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.63,0:35:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偏离路线了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.31,0:35:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我继续吗？没错 继续
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.92,0:35:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听著 伙计们
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.32,0:35:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子有点小问题 需要检查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.66,0:35:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人就得跟他驾驶的车一样棒 这是职业经验
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.16,0:35:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你照顾好车 车就会照顾好你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.53,0:35:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板说 「回到路上」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.37,0:35:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.50,0:35:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.27,0:36:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,回车里去 Frank
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.08,0:36:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.68,0:37:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了？还没
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.49,0:38:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是机灵的家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.30,0:38:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是大家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.08,0:39:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再是大家伙了 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.01,0:39:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.05,0:40:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射器 能拆下来么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.05,0:40:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有线连著
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.59,0:40:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我拆了：就爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.35,0:41:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.42,0:41:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但领带打很烂
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.16,0:41:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.69,0:41:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,累了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.66,0:41:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我更愿意与车相处的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.73,0:41:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄所见略同
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.94,0:41:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们醒过来之后…？醒了之后 我要怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.11,0:41:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许今天先放个假
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.53,0:41:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.86,0:41:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你不死 你会更不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.93,0:42:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想我死 我早就死了 你想让我活著
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.53,0:42:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我完成这个任务 我要说明一下
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.97,0:42:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在听
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.54,0:42:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,单独听
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.87,0:42:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是单独听的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.51,0:42:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 显然我不满意
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.34,0:42:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我是否满意是你首要关心的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.35,0:42:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一地点 一小时后 等我电话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.77,0:43:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.04,0:43:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我很失望
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.18,0:43:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是第一个 也不会是最后一个
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.45,0:43:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 我想一个人做这事儿 那没必要 你看…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.42,0:43:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们一开始的少许交谈后
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.69,0:43:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就一直在想 其实我不需要找最优秀的人来做这种任务
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.39,0:43:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何持有驾照的白痴都能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.76,0:43:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 引用伟大的美国人Donald Trump的话：
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.00,0:43:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 你被解雇了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.68,0:44:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.12,0:44:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新司机 我要旧的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.92,0:44:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就快被炸成肉酱了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.72,0:45:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被解雇了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.89,0:45:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.30,0:45:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很安稳 你电话打得怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.90,0:45:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,简短 系好你的安全带
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.28,0:46:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tarconi啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.48,0:46:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.68,0:46:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在想你会什么时候打来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.62,0:46:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忙死了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.02,0:46:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来猜猜 在布达佩斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.92,0:46:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也很忙嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.76,0:46:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那种方式维系像你这样的朋友关系 不会有问题 Frank
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.79,0:46:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我就不多说了 告诉我你所知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.83,0:46:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,布达佩斯有一辆黑色的梅赛德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.47,0:46:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许并不归你的朋友所有
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.74,0:46:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道那个 现在告诉我你知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.17,0:46:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有两个包在后备箱 一个女孩在前座
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.71,0:46:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄国人 我猜
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.84,0:46:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她跟这一切有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.21,0:46:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试过问她吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.38,0:46:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我没有想到呢？抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.65,0:46:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然问过了 那她说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.99,0:46:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快死了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.49,0:46:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型的 俄国人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.99,0:46:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太抑郁了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.39,0:46:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还记得 在学校时 读著陀思托耶夫斯基 然后想
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.10,0:47:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人什么时候才会笑呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.97,0:47:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,满满整页都写著
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.84,0:47:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法相信的凄酸痛苦 Frank
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.01,0:47:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 我们能省掉这节文学课吗？我这儿正闪著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.61,0:47:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是密码吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.74,0:47:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 是他们给我们戴的像手镯一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.38,0:47:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们离车太远 就会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.82,0:47:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.52,0:47:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是些美国人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.79,0:47:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,具体点呢？姓名？号码？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.82,0:47:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.06,0:47:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么总是不当回事 Frank？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.46,0:47:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天性使然
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.36,0:47:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿？我去找你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.40,0:47:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个想法可不怎么样 我们被看得很紧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.07,0:47:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你不告诉我点东西 我可帮不上什么忙
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.54,0:47:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身边有电脑么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.51,0:47:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 Frank？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.81,0:47:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,被扔在市场上 感觉很不好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.78,0:47:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏规矩的人是你 不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.82,0:47:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.15,0:47:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们扯平了 我们重新来过怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.89,0:48:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这是个握手言和的电话喽？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.66,0:48:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.93,0:48:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有去掉我手镯的东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.03,0:48:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我有你要快递的包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.90,0:48:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新坐标：2-6-12
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.84,0:48:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会带你到…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.51,0:48:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,此次交易结束的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.01,0:48:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等著你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.75,0:48:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.25,0:48:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.46,0:48:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,查到了信号 再给我们点时间…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.59,0:48:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能破译这个数字还有位置
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.20,0:48:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新手机 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.81,0:48:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的事儿吗？没了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.28,0:48:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 你这到这个坐标要带你去哪吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.36,0:49:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那儿有家餐厅 那儿的鱼你从没吃过
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.70,0:49:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟胡萝卜和黑胡椒一起烘烤
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.07,0:49:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马尼亚葡萄酒 倒并不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.24,0:49:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是作为最后的晚餐 也不算太差
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.58,0:49:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该乐观一点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.05,0:49:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个现实主义者
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.35,0:49:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友说你悲观绝望 还真是说对了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.22,0:49:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,「悲观绝望」是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.29,0:49:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 你只会看到恐惧和害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.43,0:49:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友 他凭什么这么说？他又不认识我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.63,0:49:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是大体上描述了一下 一个俄罗斯人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.10,0:49:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是俄罗斯人 我是乌克兰人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.94,0:49:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.20,0:49:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不接受 我们是不同的人 我们这儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.47,0:49:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这儿 都不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.31,0:50:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人觉得 你内心里面也并不完全那么悲观
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.89,0:50:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又从何说起？你又不了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.29,0:50:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 我看到你正在化妆打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.83,0:50:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你这么确信我们会死 还这么麻烦干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.87,0:50:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好看跟死有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.08,0:50:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.18,0:50:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.55,0:50:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊比沙岛的特产 你想来一颗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.32,0:50:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢了 你也不能吃 我们得保持清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.42,0:50:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.23,0:50:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保持清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.93,0:50:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我 你怎么说来著？保持乐观？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.27,0:51:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我 把那东西给我 把药丸给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.94,0:51:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.31,0:51:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,天
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.92,0:51:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.66,0:51:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好极了 别这样 Frank Martin 高兴点儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.13,0:51:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该高兴？药丸起效时怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.19,0:51:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会海得跟个他妈的圣诞树似的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.03,0:51:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.67,0:51:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊 无聊 无聊？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.34,0:51:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 耶
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.54,0:52:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该待在车里
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.64,0:52:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我在车里尿尿？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.28,0:52:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.36,0:52:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.95,0:52:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.48,0:53:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.94,0:53:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.63,0:53:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.87,0:54:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别喝了 行不行？怎么了？我又不开车
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.78,0:54:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想开心点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.98,0:54:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要开心点 你应该试著高兴点 而不是老这么严肃
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.65,0:54:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持乐观很重要 你说的 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.88,0:54:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起喝吧 Frankie 我不想喝
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.86,0:54:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是谁悲观绝望？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.56,0:54:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说错吧？悲观绝望？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.53,0:54:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 上车
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.77,0:54:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自由了 像鸟一样自由
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.84,0:55:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩！快！开快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.39,0:55:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丢了我的朋友！我会再给你买一瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.37,0:55:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道为什么有辆车 追在我们屁股后面吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.71,0:55:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.41,0:55:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意小点儿声吧？一开始你说我悲观绝望…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.01,0:55:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在你告诉我不要太高兴？别变来变去的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.57,0:56:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 Frank？我想我们达成了协议
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.20,0:56:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.67,0:56:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我身后的那辆车没有任何关系
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.17,0:56:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟那一点关系也没有 是不是跟你有恩怨的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.81,0:56:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.38,0:56:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是有其他势力在办事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.92,0:56:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我查一下 看看能不能找到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.52,0:56:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我现在要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.32,0:56:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,开快点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.96,0:57:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的他在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.29,0:58:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.26,0:58:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.23,0:58:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿啦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.73,0:58:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,早该想到买块三明治 而不是伏特加
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.17,0:58:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.61,0:58:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会儿我不是饿 是渴
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.95,0:59:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要那样针对我？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.95,0:59:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是针对 我才没这个心思 - 「没心思」是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.79,0:59:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是没心思
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.11,0:59:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,射轮胎！快！抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.91,0:59:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下！射他！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.19,0:59:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么飞机！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.54,0:59:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,开快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.21,1:00:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停车！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.71,1:00:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 挂了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.95,1:01:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.58,1:01:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太紧张了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.42,1:01:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不著你来说
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.02,1:01:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来给你放松放松 如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.03,1:01:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我很在行
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.33,1:01:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,消除紧张
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.57,1:01:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.94,1:01:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想在死之前 再一次感受性爱
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.91,1:01:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不想吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.65,1:01:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那跟你还有死 有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.52,1:01:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有什么问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.79,1:01:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我不够性感？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.43,1:01:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 你很性感
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.60,1:02:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你是同志
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.90,1:02:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是同志
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.34,1:02:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不介意的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.38,1:02:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是 好不好？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.25,1:02:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还有什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.02,1:02:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想到过 可能是我没心情？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.11,1:02:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为规则是 不能打开包裹 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.84,1:02:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果破坏了规矩 还要它干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.81,1:02:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一直这样问我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.98,1:02:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话薄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.39,1:03:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是那个包裹 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.83,1:03:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不早说
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.73,1:03:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么区别么？有
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.40,1:03:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.97,1:03:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 在停车场…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.61,1:03:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脱掉衣服的时候 真是让人兴奋
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.68,1:03:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时正竭力不让那五个白痴抓住我们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.55,1:03:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不觉得有什么好兴奋的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.18,1:03:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为 只有男人才会被脱衣舞勾起欲望？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.46,1:03:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不喜欢事情变成这样 Valentina
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.69,1:03:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能为我再脱一次吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.36,1:03:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我钥匙 这并不好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.20,1:03:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要钥匙？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.87,1:03:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 这才是我想要的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.37,1:03:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这是你我最后一次好好玩的机会了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.84,1:03:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是玩的地方 现在也不是玩的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.55,1:03:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么我会在此时此刻 对你有感觉呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.82,1:04:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我需要分析 我会去找心理医生
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.32,1:04:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 把钥匙给我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.09,1:04:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 Frank Martin
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.62,1:04:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.91,1:04:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吧？够不够？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.62,1:04:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够 那不叫脱衣舞 Frank
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.59,1:04:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱衣舞得性感 你知道的 扭扭屁股
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.46,1:04:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 Frank Martin
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.76,1:04:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要钥匙？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.06,1:04:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要脱衣舞
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.07,1:04:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我做这些 你知道会有什么后果么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.87,1:04:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打我？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.87,1:04:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是开始
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.31,1:05:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我绑起来？你会喜欢的 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.38,1:05:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢粗暴型的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.35,1:05:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.66,1:05:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 但别太粗暴了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.43,1:05:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易是脱衣舞换钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.00,1:05:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,新交易 吻我 我就给你钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.11,1:05:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,用点儿心
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.72,1:05:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有真心吻过一个人么 Frank？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.02,1:05:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也许没有
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.59,1:05:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 你是一个人住的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.86,1:05:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论在家还是在外
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.60,1:05:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 你并不惧怕死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.77,1:05:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是惧怕生活
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.90,1:06:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起生活吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.64,1:06:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这一次
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.61,1:06:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这会儿 跟我一起生活
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.38,1:06:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的位置在哪？我们跟丢了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.42,1:06:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进了山区 我们接收不到那里的信号
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.59,1:06:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,侵入军用卫星
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.20,1:07:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.50,1:07:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们是在玩游戏吗 部长先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.97,1:07:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.97,1:07:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说一辆载著你无能手下的黑色轿车
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.51,1:07:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再有这样的动作 你就再也别想见到你女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.78,1:07:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想听听她的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.38,1:07:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等合约签好传过来之后吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.22,1:07:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听不到她的声音 我是不会签的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.82,1:07:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有强硬的资格 部长先生
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.62,1:07:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 你也没有 Johnson先生
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.40,1:07:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我知道你是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.46,1:07:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢保证 如果我女儿有什么闪失…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.73,1:07:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会动用我所有的权力
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.80,1:07:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你 让你用最可怕的方式来偿还
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.64,1:07:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始行动
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.05,1:07:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,接啊 Frank 快接
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.77,1:08:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在伊比沙岛 度假
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.75,1:08:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人递给我一杯香槟
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.21,1:08:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喝了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.75,1:08:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后觉得有点儿不舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.17,1:08:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了洗手间 之后的事儿我就不知道了 等我醒来时 就在这车上了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.50,1:08:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问他：「这是哪儿？」 他说他只是个送货的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.18,1:08:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的车开得很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.48,1:09:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 没有你棒
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.72,1:09:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他：「求你了 我父亲是个有权有势的人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.76,1:09:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有影响力 认识很多人 让我给他打个电话吧「
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.53,1:09:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很害怕 他以前从没这样做过
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.67,1:09:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来应该很简单的 载人 离开 来钱很容易
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.44,1:09:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人告诉他 不能打电话 不能离开车
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.41,1:09:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我说服了他
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.04,1:09:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打了电话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.35,1:09:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还没来得及跟父亲说上话…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.78,1:09:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 快！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.76,1:09:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逃走了 但…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.59,1:09:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人朝我们开枪 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.43,1:09:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么要杀我们呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.80,1:09:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他们开枪 是因为我们没有遵造计划
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.07,1:10:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 「好吧 那是旧计划 新的计划呢？」
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.74,1:10:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他有一个朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.95,1:10:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我就遇到了你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.06,1:10:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你 我就觉得安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.33,1:10:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至都不认识我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.30,1:10:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然不认识你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.90,1:10:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是感觉 不是认不认识
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.54,1:10:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有那种感觉 你表达的方式真是有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.65,1:10:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对女人来说 有一点神秘感会更好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.45,1:10:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.49,1:10:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.49,1:10:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 只是一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.22,1:11:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回到雷达监控上了 先生
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.43,1:11:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你他妈到底在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.53,1:11:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在去布加勒斯特的路上
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.06,1:11:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点换了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.54,1:11:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,新坐标：3-7-13
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.08,1:12:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 部长先生
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.51,1:12:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 请稍等
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.88,1:12:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是警长Tarconi 来自马赛
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.59,1:12:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,说马赛也不是很准确…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.05,1:12:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是马赛东边的一个小镇 你想做什么呢 警长？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.19,1:12:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,和您谈谈 我没时间
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.86,1:12:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟您的女儿有关
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.60,1:12:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,敖德萨 Frank 我的故乡
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.87,1:12:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我回家了 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.05,1:12:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不去布加勒斯特了？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.55,1:12:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划有变 变得好 我更喜欢敖德萨
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.05,1:13:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.59,1:13:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是期待著鱼和胡萝卜呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.93,1:13:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这儿的食物更美味
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.13,1:13:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道基辅鸡吗？当然
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.43,1:13:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这儿的一家餐厅
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.84,1:13:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是世界上最棒的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.37,1:13:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡肉鲜美 还有黄油 当它溢出来时…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.91,1:13:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不敢相信 会有多美味
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.75,1:13:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我现在是什么感觉吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.85,1:13:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿了？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.66,1:13:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉安全
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.04,1:13:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会像电影的结局那样吗 从此过著幸福快乐的生活？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.54,1:13:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 这一切都将成为褪色的回忆
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.65,1:14:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我微笑著坐在基辅鸡店里
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.92,1:14:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.41,1:14:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生 决定做好了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.21,1:14:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了 一旦跟我女儿通过话 就可以签合同
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.48,1:14:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.92,1:14:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把笔准备好 一会儿打给你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.20,1:14:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我们要收网了 Frank
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.97,1:14:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 收网的时候 确保没人来把我拖下车
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.50,1:14:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在知道这是怎么回事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.27,1:14:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩 她父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.11,1:15:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,和大量的有毒废料
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.85,1:15:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场交易 他的签名换她的命
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.92,1:15:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有我的信誉 警长
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.19,1:15:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成送货任务率是百分之百
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.62,1:15:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像听出来点儿什么苗头？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.59,1:15:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我所认识的Frank 他的规则是 不问姓名 不牵涉感情
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.07,1:15:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么每个人都对我的规则那么感兴趣？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.97,1:15:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 我一直认为 其实你的内心是浪漫的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.54,1:15:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的事儿吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.74,1:15:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的地在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.61,1:15:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再打给你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.29,1:15:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 快结束了 Frank
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.12,1:15:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把坐标给我 没有坐标了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.39,1:15:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你现在那条路上
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.73,1:15:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个路口左拐
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.86,1:15:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道我要去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.14,1:16:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了你就知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.64,1:16:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要担心 这地方正是我想带他们来的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.85,1:16:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很欣赏你 Frank
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.01,1:16:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的能力果然值得我们信任
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.22,1:16:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你可以让那女孩出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.69,1:16:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她马上出去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.56,1:16:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不走
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.36,1:16:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要你 他们不会杀你的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.70,1:17:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们会杀你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.53,1:17:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我看上去像那种穿越半个欧洲 然后死在桥上的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.04,1:17:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.31,1:17:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可没有这么多耐心 Frank
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.62,1:17:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有那么多人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.39,1:17:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都有枪
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.52,1:17:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会没事呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.86,1:17:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚饭的时候告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.83,1:17:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.00,1:17:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.44,1:17:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,吻我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.05,1:18:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.43,1:18:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会害死我的 快 出去
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.69,1:18:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓她啊 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.25,1:19:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 好点了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.77,1:19:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.79,1:19:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！Frank！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.37,1:19:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的爱车将成为他的坟墓
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.07,1:20:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬出来 他会被炸死 留里面 他会被淹死 我们撤吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.19,1:20:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tarconi 女孩在他们手上
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.46,1:20:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 我们试著从手机信号追踪他
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.09,1:20:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿？湖里
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.56,1:20:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,湖？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.70,1:20:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能具体点吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.77,1:20:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有个水坝
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.71,1:20:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,水坝？我知道那个地方 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.84,1:20:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,多远？至少要十分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.88,1:20:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 我们十分钟左右到
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.91,1:20:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,能快点儿吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.68,1:20:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会尽力的 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.43,1:22:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把全部人的票都买了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.54,1:22:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.14,1:22:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管这车去哪儿 我们得继续走半个小时
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.27,1:22:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们不继续开车走呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.85,1:22:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,改日再算
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.76,1:23:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官！那儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.48,1:23:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 出去！所有人都出去！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.86,1:23:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 滚！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.02,1:23:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.54,1:23:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生？是的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.85,1:23:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想跟你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.88,1:24:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.12,1:24:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要签
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.49,1:24:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有15分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.84,1:24:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有查出这究竟是怎么回事？废料
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.74,1:24:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈的是多少废料呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.21,1:24:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够污染半个国家一百年的废料
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.98,1:24:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再试一次
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.70,1:24:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个现代女性 你是相当的无知
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.30,1:24:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个新世界
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.14,1:25:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再有国家 那是旧的观念
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.84,1:25:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有现实的经济利益 赢利和亏损
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.41,1:25:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,效率和浪费
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.35,1:25:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,放眼全球 不再有地域之分
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.15,1:25:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.90,1:25:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？进展如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.48,1:25:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快完成了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.62,1:25:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.18,1:25:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 他在火车上
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.85,1:25:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪儿？这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.39,1:25:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在那儿跟火车接上头
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.26,1:25:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个主意不错 就这么办
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.03,1:25:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 Frank 拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.77,1:26:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生 我向您保证 一切尽在掌握之中
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.54,1:26:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信是的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.84,1:26:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有什么问题 我知道你们会解决的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.61,1:26:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 请先出去吧…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.91,1:27:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不信 但在我内心里 我是一个和平主义者
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.71,1:27:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌暴力
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.78,1:27:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴力造成的问题比能解决的要多
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.22,1:27:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的一切 也并不是我所愿意的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.56,1:27:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,客户提出了要求…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.10,1:27:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想用最少的血…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.40,1:27:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,来达到他的要求
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.37,1:27:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是没有人愿意合作 你不想 第一个司机不想…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.30,1:27:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲不想 刚死掉的Frank Martin也不想
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.21,1:27:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都想反抗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.16,1:28:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.60,1:28:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听一个死人说话
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.96,1:30:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,再走走试试啊 Frank
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.33,1:30:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 再走走
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.48,1:31:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.28,1:31:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.22,1:31:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,8：58 他签了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.69,1:31:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天呐
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.06,1:31:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 Frank 不 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.50,1:32:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了 Frank 结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.21,1:32:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务完成了 你和那女孩可以走了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.28,1:32:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 你的能力让我印象深刻…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.81,1:32:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你提供一份职位
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.68,1:32:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想给你提供一份 永远残废
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.27,1:32:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌浪费人材
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.81,1:32:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的不觉得我们合得来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.31,1:32:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.60,1:33:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.64,1:33:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不合适 但你和手镯炸弹是天生一对
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.38,1:33:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.96,1:33:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.63,1:33:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.58,1:34:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在做正确的事
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.30,1:34:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Valentina啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.18,1:34:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Valentina啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.72,1:34:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上天堂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.99,1:34:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来更像是地狱
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.76,1:34:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.90,1:34:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.91,1:35:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.18,1:35:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生 您女儿在我们这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.85,1:35:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.97,1:35:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？如你所说 做正确的事
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.57,1:35:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 先生们 失陪 我去要开会了…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.01,1:35:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在会上我会说 跟你这样的人做生意是很危险的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.14,1:35:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.33,1:35:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃生艇下水了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.56,1:35:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在水上了 先生 等著呢 快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.63,1:35:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带上航海日志 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.09,1:36:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.16,1:36:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候 我爸和我…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.33,1:36:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是能从这儿钓上来鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.86,1:36:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,时代变了 警长
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.10,1:36:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,人也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.84,1:36:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.34,1:36:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为这个言论很准确
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.38,1:36:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开著原来的车 住在原来的房子里
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.81,1:36:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我不是指你的车或是房子
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.82,1:36:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,大海真是宁静啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.39,1:36:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,午餐准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.82,1:36:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 事物发展是有先后的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.33,1:37:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃午餐 得先钓到鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.86,1:37:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们继续闲聊 还不集中精神的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.30,1:37:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么都钓不到
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.83,1:37:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个更好的主意 为什么我们不跳过抓鱼这步…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.77,1:37:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接去吃午餐呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.91,1:37:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道离这不远 有个很棒的地方…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.28,1:37:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们焖的鱼 超级美味
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.38,1:37:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,用番茄和洋葱 撒上少量的野生薰衣草
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.85,1:37:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,配什么酒呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.96,1:37:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃红的葡萄酒 南方货
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.99,1:37:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还是城堡里储藏的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.29,1:37:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要加冰 - 当然要加冰
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.93,1:37:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜点呢？
